        <keyword>는 맥스웰(J. C. Maxwell)</keyword>
        <keyword>의 양변에 발산 연산 (divergence operation)</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$\nabla \bullet {\vec{J}} = - \frac{\partial \rho}{\partial t}$ $\frac{\partial \rho}{\partial t}$ 변위전류밀도</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
